SUMMARY:KVM and Live Update
LOCATION:Club E\, Prague Congress Centre
DESCRIPTION:KVM MC · Paolo Bonzini\, Sean Christopherson · https://lpc.ev
 ents/event/20/contributions/2632/\n\nDuring this session\, the maintainers
  of KVM welcome discussion around other topics related to live update and 
 the Caretaker that did not fit in the previous hour\, including:\n* guest_
 memfd live update\n* stable ABI for live update\n* reusing the Caretaker c
 oncept for pKVM\n\nThe above list is just a suggestion\, as we will take o
 ther topics from the audience if there are any.
URL:https://lpc.events/event/20/contributions/2632/
END:VEVENT
